-- Sample for local development and demos, cut from a full load (scripts/market/load.ts):
-- seven atlas crops (rice, maize, robusta coffee, black pepper, cassava, soybean, mango) in
-- Viet Nam, the United States and India, with annual producer prices since 2015.
-- Values are those of the crop atlas (data/crops/atlas/) and of FAOSTAT Producer Prices
-- (release 2026-10-09), unchanged. For the whole dataset run `npm run db:load` against the
-- local stack (docs/DATABASE.md).

